        <item>
            <title>0.1.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 19:35:40 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/GooZhenJie/skywrite/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[First release.

Skywrite keeps short notes on your screen, above other windows, with no background or window frame. Each note is a Markdown file in a folder you choose. Notes can be moved, resized, zoomed and pinned, and ⌃⌥H hides or shows all of them. Settings › Appearance adds Soft Edge or Liquid Glass backgrounds.

Skywrite can check for updates and asks before doing so automatically.

Requires macOS 26 or later. The first time you open Skywrite, macOS may refuse to open it; [First launch](https://github.com/GooZhenJie/skywrite#first-launch) explains what to do.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/GooZhenJie/skywrite/releases/download/v0.1.0/Skywrite-0.1.0.zip" length="3332724" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="qroSThIvKIcmN/Et08yya4lPnhe40vF1YGv/9yL1bjwIGBj7brgs6+myX88EVHA5UnXHcze3HYG4Gad9zeN5Ag=="/>
